OL,3,AOne killed, 11 injured in second Houthi
OL,4,Astrike on Riyadh airport in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes a day after a strike on the
OL,7,Fsame airport killed 13 people and
OL,8,Finjured 308 others, following similar
OL,9,Fstrikes earlier this week.
OL,11,FThe Houthis in Yemen said they were
OL,12,Fbehind the attacks and warned airlines
OL,13,Fand passengers against using Saudi
OL,14,FArabian airports and airspace.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
